---
// AIDLC Suite cards — unified card style
---

<div class="aidlc-grid">

  <!-- VS Code Extension -->
  <div class="card ac-card">
    <div class="ac-body">
      <h3 class="ac-title">AIDLC for VS Code</h3>
      <p class="ac-tagline">VS CODE EXTENSION</p>
      <p class="ac-desc">Builder UI cho AI pipelines. Edit <code>workspace.yaml</code> visually, theo dõi run trong sidebar, và mở AIDLC Monitor cho token usage + live agent observability.</p>
      <div class="ac-tech">
        <span class="tag">TypeScript</span>
        <span class="tag">VS Code</span>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="ac-footer">
      <a class="ac-link ac-link--primary" href="https://marketplace.visualstudio.com/items?itemName=hueanmy.aidlc" target="_blank" rel="noopener">&rarr;&nbsp;VS Code Marketplace</a>
      <a class="ac-link" href="https://open-vsx.org/extension/hueanmy/aidlc" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Open VSX</a>
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- CLI -->
  <div class="card ac-card">
    <div class="ac-body">
      <h3 class="ac-title">AIDLC CLI</h3>
      <p class="ac-tagline">CLI &middot; NPM</p>
      <p class="ac-desc">Standalone engine — không cần VS Code. Scaffold workspaces, apply presets, drive runs end-to-end via Claude, và watch live từ shell.</p>
      <div class="ac-tech">
        <span class="tag">TypeScript</span>
        <span class="tag">Node.js</span>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="ac-footer">
      <a class="ac-link ac-link--primary" href="https://www.npmjs.com/package/aidlc" target="_blank" rel="noopener">&rarr;&nbsp;npm install -g aidlc</a>
      <a class="ac-link" href="https://github.com/aidlc-io/aidlc" target="_blank" rel="noopener">GitHub</a>
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- AIDLC Term -->
  <div class="card ac-card">
    <div class="ac-body">
      <h3 class="ac-title">AIDLC Term</h3>
      <p class="ac-tagline">DESKTOP &middot; MACOS &middot; WINDOWS</p>
      <p class="ac-desc">GPU-accelerated terminal cho agent work: file explorer theo shell, agent manager cho mọi Claude Code session, và live token-usage dashboard.</p>
      <div class="ac-tech">
        <span class="tag">Rust</span>
        <span class="tag">wgpu</span>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="ac-footer">
      <a class="ac-link ac-link--primary" href="https://github.com/aidlc-io/aidlc-io.github.io/releases/download/term-v0.3.2/AIDLC-Term-0.3.2.dmg">&rarr;&nbsp;Download macOS</a>
      <a class="ac-link" href="https://github.com/aidlc-io/aidlc-io.github.io/releases/download/term-v0.3.2/AIDLC-Term-0.3.2-windows.zip">Windows (beta)</a>
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- AIDLC TestAgent -->
  <div class="card ac-card">
    <div class="ac-body">
      <h3 class="ac-title">AIDLC TestAgent</h3>
      <p class="ac-tagline">CLI &middot; NPM &middot; OPEN SOURCE</p>
      <p class="ac-desc">AI test agent cho web, desktop, API &amp; mobile. Point vào target, approve plan, nhận về test suite chạy được. Không telemetry, không cần API key.</p>
      <div class="ac-tech">
        <span class="tag">TypeScript</span>
        <span class="tag">Playwright</span>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="ac-footer">
      <a class="ac-link ac-link--primary" href="https://www.npmjs.com/package/aidlc-testagent" target="_blank" rel="noopener">&rarr;&nbsp;npm install -g aidlc-testagent</a>
      <a class="ac-link" href="https://github.com/aidlc-io/aidlc-testagent" target="_blank" rel="noopener">GitHub</a>
    </div>
  </div>

</div>

<style>
  .aidlc-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);
    gap: 1.25rem;
  }
  @media (max-width: 640px) { .aidlc-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; } }

  .ac-card {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    border-radius: var(--radius);
    overflow: hidden;
  }

  .ac-body {
    flex: 1;
    padding: 1rem 1rem 0.75rem;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 0.4rem;
  }

  .ac-title {
    font-family: var(--font-serif);
    font-size: 1.0625rem;
    font-weight: 500;
    letter-spacing: -0.01em;
    color: var(--fg);
    line-height: 1.3;
    margin: 0;
  }

  .ac-tagline {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 0.625rem;
    font-weight: 500;
    letter-spacing: 0.14em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--accent);
    margin: 0;
  }

  .ac-desc {
    font-size: 0.82rem;
    color: rgba(17,16,16,0.7);
    line-height: 1.55;
    margin: 0;
    display: -webkit-box;
    -webkit-line-clamp: 3;
    -webkit-box-orient: vertical;
    overflow: hidden;
  }
  .ac-desc code {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 0.82em;
    background: var(--accent-soft);
    border-radius: 3px;
    padding: 0.05em 0.3em;
    color: var(--accent);
  }

  .ac-tech {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 0.3rem;
    margin-top: auto;
    padding-top: 0.25rem;
  }

  .ac-footer {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 1.25rem;
    padding: 0.65rem 1rem;
    border-top: 1px solid var(--border);
  }

  .ac-link {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 0.688rem;
    font-weight: 500;
    color: rgba(17,16,16,0.5);
    text-decoration: none;
    transition: color 120ms;
    white-space: nowrap;
  }
  .ac-link:hover { color: var(--fg); }
  .ac-link--primary { color: var(--accent); }
  .ac-link--primary:hover { color: var(--accent-hover); text-decoration: underline; text-underline-offset: 3px; }
</style>
